    description: Read the newsletters to get information about recent events concerning
      the series/the author. The newsletters also have little shorts involving the
      characters written for fun.
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ec7b367bc8fbcd2488c11ac53f9a7d18, type: 3}
