    chapters:
    - name: Volume 0 Full Release
      fileUrl: 
      dateAdded: 
  - name: Volume 0
    description: '"I promise, I''ll never let you go." The tides had turned for the
      Takasu family after the delivery of Taiga''s triplets had gone awry, leaving
      her terribly ill. As Ryuuji continued to work hard to care for her, Taiga''s
      mother would glare over his shoulder as her threat to take Taiga away loomed
      over the couple. Wanting to avoid that outcome at all costs, Ryuuji would do
      everything he can to keep Taiga away from any more harm by any means necessary,
      even when Taiga herself would try to go against them.\n\nA look at the future
      of the Takasu family after the events of Toradora! and the precursor to the
      spinoff sequel, Toranoko!'
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 66c2ea6b9237e23439929a1fba01395a, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 0
    chapters:
    - name: Complete Volume
      fileUrl: 
      dateAdded: 
    - name: 'Chapter 1: When You Least Expect It'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_1.pdf
      dateAdded: 27/10/25
    - name: 'Chapter 2: She''s My Responsibility'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_2.pdf
      dateAdded: 27/10/25
    - name: 'Chapter 3: Sharing The Burden'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_3.pdf
      dateAdded: 1/1/26
    - name: 'Chapter 4: Do The Right Thing'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_4.pdf
      dateAdded: 1/1/26
    - name: 'Chapter 5: I Want To See You'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_5.pdf
      dateAdded: 16/2/26
    - name: 'Chapter 6: Our Path Forward'
      fileUrl: https://infernalfury270.github.io/toranoko/read/2_6.pdf
      dateAdded: 16/2/26
  - name: Takasu Haruko
    description: Haruko began high school with a mission to ensure all her sisters
      graduate. But in her 2nd year, her focus shifted when Yuri assigned her to
      a pair project with a boy named <b>Sagawa Kaito</b>. Despite first impressions,
      a bond began to form beyond their assignment when they learned they weren't
      so different. Soon, she'd find that a new path with this boy had opened for
      her.
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e1a3cdb0ccb49e746b43bd625f938b28, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 1
    chapters: []
  - name: Takasu Mitsuko
    description: 'Mitsuko entered her high school with only one goal in mind: make
      some friends! Growing up, she was always absorbed in her books and never made
      a genuine friend. However, when her loneliness led her to catch feelings for
      a friend of her parents, she knew things had to change. After just her 1st
      year, she already had <b>Ninomae Arisa</b> and <b>Kishida Mie</b> by her side.
      But with Arisa as her best friend, could she be yearning for something more?'
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2067daf78a2bd734597944872de2c61f, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 2
    chapters: []
  - name: Takasu Taiga
    description: The tension she felt raising her daughters settled as they grew
      older. Getting calls from teachers became routine. Eventually, she decided
      to focus all her care into raising her son, Yuuchi, to ensure he grows to be
      an upstanding person. She wanted to show him more kindness, too. While his
      grades were good and he rarely got into trouble, she'd come to realise that
      she might never feel secure about her parenting.
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: be189a6c38d196f4c9f05174016e4409, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 3
    chapters: []
  - name: Haruko & Mitsuko
    description: Going into their 3rd year, the sisters had gone their separate ways.
      Bad blood had grown between Haruko and Katsuko, leading her to find a partner
      of her own. While Haruko and Mitsuko experienced challenges with their own
      relationships, Katsuko remained in the background. After feeling changes in
      their environment as a result of their split, they'd realise that they might've
      been better together after all.
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19aa75edf72722e4cb8ae00405b251fc, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 4
    chapters: []
  - name: Takasu Katsuko
    description: 'The final act and resolution.


      The story would conclude
      with their high school graduation, after a bright future would be secured for
      the three sisters.'
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f66b2ee3380025046b56242dc47e92a9, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 1
    theme: 5
    chapters: []
  - name: Toranoko!
    description: 'Katsuko applies to a university while her sisters go their own
      paths.


      An epilogue, the final volume. A look into the sisters'' future.'
    cover: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fa37d77f8ef76d4448d2aaa2a302bbb0, type: 3}
    contentWarning: 0
    theme: 6
    chapters: []
